{"song": "The_Rinn_-_Voices__2017_Version_", "config": "final_patched", "model": "models/asr", "seconds": 231.2243125, "maxNewTokens": 368, "elapsed": 408.04405212402344, "exit": 0, "chunks": [{"index": 1, "offset": 30.43, "length": 32.1, "raw": "\"The sun is fading under blood red sky. The reign of day is over.\""}, {"index": 5, "offset": 148.75, "length": 31.22, "raw": "\"A world that's gone forever long ago.\""}, {"index": 0, "offset": 0.0, "length": 30.43, "raw": "\"Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh,\""}, {"index": 3, "offset": 91.0, "length": 29.39, "raw": "\"Surprise! You're waking in the morning. Can't understand your feelings. And where do you get these thoughts inside your mind? The voice is calling for the night to rise at your side. Oh, the sky forever on and on, crossing the horizon with mist.\""}, {"index": 2, "offset": 62.52, "length": 28.48, "raw": "\"Night soon will break. Free, they wait in the glow of moonlight for guiding stars beyond our sight. Will the sky forever honor those in the night? They shine with mystery, lost within shadows of a star, whispering they will light.\""}, {"index": 4, "offset": 120.39, "length": 28.35, "raw": "\"We lost, we made the shadows of our time whispering the old lie. So hear the voice, sharing the hidden, keep the gift into you. Hear the voice, sharing the memories, sacred secrets from lost time.\""}, {"index": 6, "offset": 179.97, "length": 27.6, "raw": "\"They shine. We're lost. We're made in shadows of our time. Whispering their wills. So hear the voice, sharing the memories, keeping, keeping to you. Hear the voice, sharing the memories, sacred secrets from.\""}, {"index": 7, "offset": 207.57, "length": 23.65, "raw": "\"Hear the voice tearing the sky. Deep and deep into you. Hear the voice.\""}], "result": {"language": "English", "text": "Oh, oh,The sun is fading under blood red sky. The reign of day is over.Night soon will break. Free, they wait in the glow of moonlight for guiding stars beyond our sight. Will the sky forever honor those in the night? They shine with mystery, lost within shadows of a star, whispering they will light.Surprise! You're waking in the morning. Can't understand your feelings. And where do you get these thoughts inside your mind? The voice is calling for the night to rise at your side. Oh, the sky forever on and on, crossing the horizon with mist.We lost, we made the shadows of our time whispering the old lie. So hear the voice, sharing the hidden, keep the gift into you. Hear the voice, sharing the memories, sacred secrets from lost time.A world that's gone forever long ago.They shine. We're lost. We're made in shadows of our time. Whispering their wills. So hear the voice, sharing the memories, keeping, keeping to you. Hear the voice, sharing the memories, sacred secrets from.Hear the voice tearing the sky. Deep and deep into you. Hear the voice.", "timestamps": {"items": [{"end_time": 14.56, "start_time": 14.56, "text": "Oh"}, {"end_time": 14.56, "start_time": 14.56, "text": "oh"}, {"end_time": 54.669, "start_time": 54.669, "text": "The"}, {"end_time": 55.789, "start_time": 54.749, "text": "sun"}, {"end_time": 55.869, "start_time": 55.789, "text": "is"}, {"end_time": 56.509, "start_time": 56.029, "text": "fading"}, {"end_time": 56.829, "start_time": 56.50